cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. Please also credit Sanzo Wada, whose combinations these are."
title: "Haishoku: a verified data compilation of Sanzo Wada's color combinations"
abstract: >-
  Open data for the 348 color combinations and 159 named colors in Sanzo Wada's
  Haishoku Soukan (1933–34), as printed in the Seigensha edition A Dictionary of
  Color Combinations (2010). Colors include the printed CMYK values, a naive
  CMYK-to-RGB hex, the raw scan, and a white-balanced display hex recommended
  for screens. Code in this repository is MIT; this compilation is CC BY 4.0.
type: dataset
